    {
      "file": "web/app/src/features/frontstage/components/canvas/RenderPlanSlot.tsx",
      "rule": "react-doctor/no-static-element-interactions",
      "sourceSha256": "34e721bde2e839b7c6794bccdbfca4d67b48f12cc8c8b61c6f946c7f2fcb1dcf",
      "reason": "The block frame is role=button and tabIndex=0 in design mode, with keyboard activation below this diagnostic and pointer hover styling. In run mode the handlers are disabled and keyboard activation stays with the originating inner control. The diagnostic sees conditional handlers/role, not an unlabelled static click target. Reassessed at the migrated owner: IsolatedRuntimeSlotSurface clears a prior program's runtimeError when contributionId/program.source changes. renderBlockContent is an ordinary ReactNode-returning function with no new component type or hook owner. The outer canvas slot forwards pointer selection and owns design-mode keyboard activation (role/button, tabIndex, own-target guard); runtime control events remain with their originating controls. This div also contains native runtime content and cannot become a nested HTML button.",
      "evidence": [{"file":"web/app/src/features/frontstage/components/canvas/RenderPlanSlot.tsx","sha256":"34e721bde2e839b7c6794bccdbfca4d67b48f12cc8c8b61c6f946c7f2fcb1dcf"}, {"file":"web/app/src/features/frontstage/_tests/PageCanvas.test.tsx","sha256":"f6468cb168b54ecaedc00b2f4e659a79536b8a86121ad7b0169d37239028cdcb"}, {"file":"web/app/src/features/frontstage/_tests/page-canvas/PageCanvas-width-lifecycle.test.tsx","sha256":"4bb72768ee19af4621fcfffa34465601372bb683a97b02a49019af6c1d79933b"}, {"file":"web/app/src/features/frontstage/_tests/page-canvas/auto-height-layout.test.ts","sha256":"fc8bdeb76a7b7bba74dff2837507d22b61fd0527e39c901e28abca7f46055bfc"}, {"file":"web/app/src/features/frontstage/_tests/page-canvas/frontstage-block-interaction.bench.test.ts","sha256":"b37904733e2a3723158f091609f32432776129dc702e3effa2336704e79cc70f"}, {"file":"web/app/src/features/frontstage/_tests/page-canvas/shared-page-variables.test.ts","sha256":"c924516ad8edd0ce3c7c11a3151d104e35881d9ecdea9cd497cd620d91a32d8e"}, {"file":"web/app/src/features/frontstage/_tests/page-canvas/signal-runtime.test.ts","sha256":"6f264021574970150b84a29a4fe7d31e9c47b3c3e06f6c8c280d3b927d0ff403"}, {"file":"web/app/src/features/frontstage/components/PageCanvas.tsx","sha256":"a3223a448da2d1bcbb24f68b8f5f3811d4ff45fbab12f6147d6e75996000a019"}, {"file":"web/app/src/features/frontstage/lib/page-canvas/geometry/_tests/use-canvas-width.test.tsx","sha256":"51cc42c97a3d6ab3418ae7dea8e248a6d6c1bd298e822a850f6760adfa43305d"}, {"file":"web/app/src/features/frontstage/lib/page-canvas/geometry/_tests/view-mode-transitions.test.ts","sha256":"7e907499fe081a6a880eb42e93ed506c1b2cc098c4189a0a00aeb5168b870d51"}]
