      "reason": "The flagged render-prefixed function is invoked normally; React does not treat that call as a new component type. PageCanvas coordinates a page-id-scoped signal session, tab/page-scoped coordinator, measurements and runtime slots. Runtime slot/width/auto-height modules already own sub-responsibilities. The page change clears measurement epochs and creates a fresh batch, while block changes update the retained coordinator instead of disposing active sessions. Reassessed at the migrated owner: IsolatedRuntimeSlotSurface clears a prior program's runtimeError when contributionId/program.source changes. renderBlockContent is an ordinary ReactNode-returning function with no new component type or hook owner. The outer canvas slot forwards pointer selection and owns design-mode keyboard activation (role/button, tabIndex, own-target guard); runtime control events remain with their originating controls. This div also contains native runtime content and cannot become a nested HTML button.",
